[02:54] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: '$10,000 Canadian. Number two. The second thing I\'m asked to do all the time is making inputs easier, and this is particularly common with service businesses like any sort of field technician, movers, cleaners, like anybody out in the field doing hands-on'

